1
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,040
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:14,440
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:17,400
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,960
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,000
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,760
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,480
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:33,280
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,480
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:40,720
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,000
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,280
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:50,560
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,000
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,320
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,400
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,040
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,920
=Episode 3=

20
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:33,920
You...

21
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,400
(As long as you keep quiet,)

22
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:41,040
(she won't know it's you.)

23
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,000
You're not Cheng Mingzhi.

24
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,760
How can you tell?

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,640
His steps are lighter,

26
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,959
and his breathing is steadier.

27
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,400
You're nothing like him.

28
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,640
Little blind girl.

29
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,400
You're pretty sharp.

30
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:08,120
(You want to ruin my reputation?)

31
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:09,240
(Fine.)

32
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,319
(You're not getting away so easily.)

33
00:02:11,759 --> 00:02:13,639
Do you know why I haven't screamed?

34
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:30,280
(This little blind girl
is quite a looker.)

35
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,560
Because...

36
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,439
I don't mind.

37
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:41,639
Cheng Mingzhi is hardly ever home.

38
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:46,280
As a blind woman,
you're the only one I can count on

39
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:49,319
in the Cheng family.

40
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,840
Are you...

41
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,159
Are you serious?

42
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:57,719
Cheng Xiao,

43
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,400
have some tea.

44
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:04,159
What happened tonight

45
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:06,479
stays between you and me.

46
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,560
Good.

47
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,599
Cheng Xiao,

48
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,680
go ahead.

49
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,840
What are you doing?

50
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:48,599
Help!

51
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:50,159
Someone, help!

52
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:51,120
- You said you wouldn't scream!
- Help!

53
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,759
And now you're screaming?

54
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,319
Someone's breaking into my room!

55
00:03:53,319 --> 00:03:54,159
- Help!
- Go see what's happening!

56
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,159
- What's going on?
- Someone, help!

57
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,039
- Go check it out!
- Hurry!

58
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:58,800
Hurry!

59
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,919
(Double Happiness)
Help!

60
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,639
Hurry!

61
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:01,719
Help!

62
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,080
Help!

63
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,800
What's all this commotion at this hour?

64
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,840
(Cheng Dingbang,
Cheng family's fourth uncle)

65
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,800
Mother.

66
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,120
I'm here.

67
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,159
Cheng Xiao?

68
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,439
You...

69
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,520
What happened?

70
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,199
I had too much to drink

71
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:21,040
and stumbled into the wrong room.

72
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,240
She... tried to seduce me!

73
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,360
Well, well!

74
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,480
So you tried to seduce my son,
you shameless wretch!

75
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,600
Madam,

76
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,600
look at her.

77
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,040
She's practically naked!

78
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,240
Second Aunt,

79
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,920
if I wanted to seduce him,

80
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,600
why would I scream for help?

81
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:37,120
If I hadn't been woken
by that falling candlestick,

82
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,279
I would've been...

83
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:40,079
by now.

84
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,839
Second Young Master,

85
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,560
who took off your clothes?

86
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,240
It's her!

87
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,040
She did!

88
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:47,959
She failed to seduce me,

89
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,720
and now she's framing me!

90
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,000
I'm blind.

91
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,759
How could I have taken off your clothes?

92
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,360
Who knows what you're really up to?

93
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:57,959
Dingbang!

94
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,879
Say something!

95
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,839
This is outrageous!

96
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:03,399
Look at this.

97
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,759
Fourth Uncle.

98
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,240
I'm blind.

99
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,519
I can barely find my way around.

100
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,920
If I wanted to seduce Cheng Xiao,

101
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,959
how would I know he'd come here tonight?

102
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:31,639
And he just happened to show up
while my husband was away.

103
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,920
Surely

104
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,680
someone tipped him off,

105
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:38,560
and someone was watching the door!

106
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:40,360
Fourth Uncle,

107
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,120
who do you think that was?

108
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,040
You're making things up!

109
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,600
Lanxin.

110
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,360
- She has a point.
- Dingbang!

111
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,759
Whose side are you on?

112
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,040
She's humiliating Xiao
right in front of everyone!

113
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:54,319
Are you blind too?

114
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,519
- I...
- Second Aunt,

115
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:58,040
anyone can see what's going on.

116
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,600
So who's really blind here? You or me?

117
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,240
I'll tear your mouth to shreds!

118
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,839
Mother,

119
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,839
you decide.

120
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,759
Guards!

121
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,360
Take Second Young Master away!

122
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,199
Give him twenty strokes!

123
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,519
- Mother, save me!
- Madam!

124
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,160
- Madam!
- Save me!

125
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:34,720
Lanxin.

126
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:36,720
- Save me, Mother!
- One more word,

127
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:38,360
and you'll be punished too!

128
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,800
Whatever happened tonight,

129
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,959
right or wrong,

130
00:06:46,199 --> 00:06:48,279
this family's reputation
must be protected.

131
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:50,920
If anyone lets a word of this slip,

132
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:53,040
they'll face family punishment.

133
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:54,879
Everyone, leave.

134
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,680
That's enough.

135
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,879
Wait for me!

136
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,160
Someone, come here!

137
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:38,480
It'd be a shame not to have a drink
on our wedding night.

138
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,199
Here.

139
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,639
You took off his clothes,

140
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:06,480
didn't you?

141
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:08,879
I did.

142
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,079
You tore yours too,

143
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,120
didn't you?

144
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,839
The tear is in the wrong direction.

145
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,319
If someone else had torn them,

146
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,079
the tear would run from top to bottom.

147
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,560
But if you tore them yourself,

148
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,639
it would run from bottom to top.

149
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,560
I tore them myself.

150
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,679
You're even sharper than I thought.

151
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:37,320
Second Aunt tried to ruin me
with that dirty trick.

152
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,039
I'm just trying to survive.

153
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:04,440
Young General...

154
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,559
Could you

155
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,840
let me feel your face?

156
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,879
I've been blind for so long,

157
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:16,279
and no one's ever made me feel

158
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,480
that seeing them would be worth it.

159
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,320
You're the first.

160
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,640
♪Amid a sea of faces♪

161
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:25,960
♪I never meant to fall into this♪

162
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:32,160
♪Yet my eyes met yours♪

163
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,160
♪One glance exchanged♪

164
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:39,920
♪And my heart was swept away♪

165
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:45,720
♪Before I knew it, I was lost in you♪

166
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:51,040
♪Your face♪

167
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:55,080
♪Stirs my heart so easily♪

168
00:09:55,080 --> 00:10:01,240
♪Yet no words to express my feelings♪

169
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:04,680
♪I borrow the moonlight and breeze
to write it down♪

170
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,280
Are you handsome?

171
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,759
Not bad.

172
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:15,440
♪I write of love
at that first fleeting glance♪

173
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,639
You can leave now.

174
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:19,200
I need some rest.

175
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:23,840
♪We rarely meet,
yet here I paint our story♪

176
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:26,160
♪A thousand springs could pass♪

177
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:31,200
♪And none would match this moment♪

178
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,720
"Not bad" means he's just average.

179
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,720
(At the Cheng Residence,)

180
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:02,640
(don't... trust...)

181
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:06,440
(any... single... one.)

182
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:15,039
Madam, Young Master was lucky
to escape disaster.

183
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,960
But I suspect

184
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:20,039
he's keeping something from you.

185
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:25,600
Mingzhi has always had doubts
about Third Madam's death

186
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:28,399
and his grandfather's death.

187
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,879
Then, Madam...

188
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,519
Leave him be.

189
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:41,560
(Cheng Residence)

190
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,279
My Lady,

191
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,639
I'm bringing you breakfast.

192
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,879
Oh, you're up early.

193
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,200
After what happened last night,

194
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,399
I thought you'd sleep in.

195
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:01,440
Just leave it there.

196
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,720
My Lady,

197
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,720
there's something

198
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,360
I'm not sure I should tell you.

199
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,159
Then don't.

200
00:12:19,919 --> 00:12:23,639
Last night, in Young General's study,

201
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:25,799
he told me all sorts of things.

202
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,559
He said

203
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:30,320
the elders arranged this marriage,

204
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,919
and he never wanted it.

205
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:34,559
He also said

206
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,840
I have served him for five years,

207
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,799
and he does have feelings for me.

208
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:42,720
He'll give me a proper place soon.

209
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:43,759
Wan'er,

210
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:44,840
are you finished?

211
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,559
Are you trying to make me jealous

212
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:50,279
or scare me off?

213
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:54,960
How long were you in the study
last night?

214
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,399
You know the answer.

215
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,600
I won't expose you,

216
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,919
out of respect for you.

217
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:02,039
But if you come here
to flaunt yourself again,

218
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:04,879
I won't let you off so easily.

219
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,720
You're right, My Lady.

220
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,200
I only came to bring you breakfast.

221
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,480
As for the tea...

222
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,960
Since you're blind,

223
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,879
making tea must be difficult.

224
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:19,879
Let me help you.

225
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,960
How thoughtful of you.

226
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,559
I'll make the tea myself.

227
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,720
Otherwise, people might say

228
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:29,720
I can't even make tea
as the principal wife.

229
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:34,120
You're right, My Lady.

230
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:36,559
I'll leave you to it, then.

231
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:55,440
Wan'er.

232
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,480
You said Young General
has feelings for you.

233
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:05,000
But you've served here for five years.

234
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,559
If he really wanted you,

235
00:14:06,559 --> 00:14:08,440
you'd be the Young Madam by now.

236
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:14,320
A wife in name only,
a lowly servant, a cheap concubine.

237
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,759
Those words describe you perfectly.

238
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,240
(You little wretch!)

239
00:14:21,399 --> 00:14:23,080
(Let's see how long you stay so smug!)

240
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,799
(You'll pay soon enough!)

241
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:30,879
(If that's how you want it,)

242
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:33,080
(don't blame me for what's coming.)

243
00:14:57,480 --> 00:15:02,880
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

244
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:08,960
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

245
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:13,280
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

246
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:16,400
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

247
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:22,760
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

248
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:29,360
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

249
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,560
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

250
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:36,080
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

251
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,640
♪Cutting through old years♪

252
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:40,480
♪We can never embrace again♪

253
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:45,880
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

254
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,540
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

255
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:50,640
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

256
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:52,480
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

257
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:54,280
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

258
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:57,440
♪Too late to pull away♪

259
00:15:57,440 --> 00:16:00,120
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

260
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:04,360
♪Now we must part♪

261
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:07,760
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

262
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:11,760
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

263
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,800
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

264
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:18,680
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
